        "org.opentripplanner.routing.api.request.RouteRequestPathComparatorSupport"
      ],
      "details": "Move the implementation of getPathComparator(boolean), including the selection between DurationComparator and PathComparator, into RouteRequestPathComparatorSupport. Retain RouteRequest.getPathComparator(boolean) as a compatibility method delegating to the support class with the existing pathComparator value and compareStartTimes argument. Keep Comparator and GraphPath direct dependencies in RouteRequest because they remain in the public method signature. Remove the direct DurationComparator and PathComparator dependencies from RouteRequest and introduce only RouteRequestPathComparatorSupport, yielding an expected net Fan-Out reduction of one.",
      "risk": "medium"
    },
    {
      "op": "ADD_OR_UPDATE_IMPORTS",
      "inputs": [
        "src/main/java/org/opentripplanner/routing/api/request/RouteRequest.java",
        "src/main/java/org/opentripplanner/routing/api/request/RouteRequestPathComparatorSupport.java"
      ],
      "outputs": [
        "src/main/java/org/opentripplanner/routing/api/request/RouteRequest.java",
        "src/main/java/org/opentripplanner/routing/api/request/RouteRequestPathComparatorSupport.java"
      ],
      "details": "Remove DurationComparator and PathComparator imports from RouteRequest after delegation is introduced. Add the imports required by RouteRequestPathComparatorSupport for Comparator, GraphPath, DurationComparator, and PathComparator. Preserve the existing Comparator<GraphPath> return type in RouteRequest.",
      "risk": "low"
    },
